<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the the Panhandle area late Monday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported good inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 1,100 slaughter steers and 1,300 slaughter heifers; 21,400 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 14,400 formulated cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1000-1150 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:    2,400     Week Ago:  None     Year Ago:  1,300</p>
<p>Wk to date:  21,400     Week Ago:  800	Year Ago: 12,600</p>
